Do not take the custom GSSAPI library path from an unsafe session.

A session opened from a URL is loaded with Unsafe set, which drops the other
settings that could run code. GSSCustom names a library that is loaded on
connect, so apply it only when the session is not unsafe, like GSSLibs beside
it. Carried as one line to keep the hunk's line count.

--- a/source/core/SessionData.cpp
+++ b/source/core/SessionData.cpp
@@ -771,1 +771,1 @@
-  GssLibCustom = Storage->ReadString(L"GSSCustom", GssLibCustom);
+  GssLibCustom = Unsafe ? GssLibCustom : Storage->ReadString(L"GSSCustom", GssLibCustom);
